REM The same chain on the recorded take rather than the guitar.
REM
REM What it is for: the take is the same three seconds every time, so two runs
REM can be compared and the numbers in the status line mean something.  With a
REM guitar the input is whatever was played, and a load figure from one is not
REM a load figure from the other.
run c:\STOMP.AXE jcm800 os 2 blk 64 cabms 23 cab c:\CAB.WAV play c:\DI.WAV out pcm0
